>VpBh
sarvavedā na tat kuryuḥ sarvaśāstrāṇi khecaraḥ | sarvatīrthābhiṣekaś ca yat kuryāt prāṇināṃ dayām || 44 ||
>VpBh-A
sarvavedā na saṃsturyu sarvaśāstrāṇi khecaraḥ | sarvatīrthābhiṣekaś ca yaḥ kuryāt prāṇināṃ dayām || 44 ||
>VpBh-B
sarvavedā na tat kuryuḥ sarvaśāstrāṇi khecaraḥ | sarvatīrthābhiṣekaś ca yat kuryāt prāṇināṃ dayām || 44 ||
>VpBh-C
sarvavedā na tat kuryuḥ sarvaśāstrāṇi khecaraḥ | sarvatīrthābhiṣekaś ca yat kuryāt prāṇināṃ dayām || 44 ||
>VpBh-D
sarvavedā na tat kuryuḥ sarvaśāstrāṇi khecaraḥ | sarvatīrthābhiṣekaś ca yat kuryāt prāṇināṃ dayām || 44 ||
